    "regime_notes": "Positive IC in 2020-24 (+0.027274), 2025-27 (+0.039251), 2028-29 (+0.027993), 2030-31 (+0.019482), and 2032 YTD (+0.099206; 14 observations). Recent Aug 2031-Feb 2032 IC was +0.084854 over 123 observations; interpret short recent samples cautiously."
  },
